WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.608 --> 00:00:10.511
Teachers get a link to this page
from the faculty office.

2
00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.514
Email and kennitala – the kennitala
links the answer to the teacher.

3
00:00:16.614 --> 00:00:21.516
Find the course by number
or name.

4
00:00:21.616 --> 00:00:27.519
Weeks: choose all, then untick
the ones you do not teach.

5
00:00:27.619 --> 00:00:31.522
Times: one click = suits well.

6
00:00:31.622 --> 00:00:35.524
Two clicks = does not suit
(at most five).

7
00:00:35.624 --> 00:00:40.527
Rooms the same way – “hentar ekki”
puts a room last.

8
00:00:40.627 --> 00:00:45.012
A note to the office.

9
00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:49.014
Yfirlit (summary): what
will be sent.

10
00:00:49.114 --> 00:00:54.017
Send. It can be sent again –
the last answer counts.
